1
00:00:17,553 --> 00:00:20,585
Stick on the ground — silence breaks,

2
00:00:23,138 --> 00:00:26,010
Magicians laugh, they summon snakes.

3
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:31,435
Smoke and mirrors, hiss and coil,

4
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:38,616
But truth don’t bend to borrowed soil.

5
00:00:39,893 --> 00:00:42,606
They spin their tricks, the crowd's amazed,

6
00:00:45,798 --> 00:00:48,511
Sparks and whispers, the court is dazed.

7
00:00:51,143 --> 00:00:53,777
But one step forward, the moment flips,

8
00:00:54,414 --> 00:00:56,728
Power lives in a prophet’s grip.

9
00:00:57,286 --> 00:00:59,680
Wood turns fire, staff takes breath,

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,552
Snake of the living swallows death.

11
00:01:02,633 --> 00:01:05,266
Illusions fade in the holy quake,

12
00:01:05,426 --> 00:01:08,218
They can fake the form, but they can't remake.

13
00:01:11,409 --> 00:01:13,962
Sticky stick, strike the ground,

14
00:01:14,281 --> 00:01:16,676
Watch the lies come tumbling down.

15
00:01:17,153 --> 00:01:19,468
One true flame the shadows fear,

16
00:01:20,346 --> 00:01:22,819
Every trick disappears.

17
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:33,031
Magicians tremble, the crowd goes still,

18
00:01:35,983 --> 00:01:38,378
Every falsehood bends to will.

19
00:01:41,010 --> 00:01:43,962
Wood of the earth, voice of the skies,

20
00:01:45,638 --> 00:01:50,983
No disguise survives the rise.

21
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:55,132
Their snakes hiss once, then swallowed whole,

22
00:01:58,483 --> 00:02:01,436
Dust to dust, no spark, no soul.

23
00:02:03,909 --> 00:02:06,781
The stick remains, alive, awake,

24
00:02:06,941 --> 00:02:10,052
The truth endures what the fakers break.

25
00:02:11,649 --> 00:02:14,520
No tricks, no sleight, no copy, no clone,

26
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:17,394
The living current is truth alone.

27
00:02:17,394 --> 00:02:20,265
What's hollow dies, what's real will stay,

28
00:02:20,425 --> 00:02:23,058
The stick remembers, the stick obeys.

29
00:02:26,888 --> 00:02:29,282
Sticky stick, strike the ground,

30
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:32,153
Watch the lies come tumbling down.

31
00:02:32,633 --> 00:02:34,947
One true flame the shadows fear,

32
00:02:35,824 --> 00:02:38,217
Every trick disappears.

33
00:02:40,451 --> 00:02:42,206
Sticky stick, strike the ground,

34
00:02:42,526 --> 00:02:44,840
Watch the lies come tumbling down.

35
00:02:45,318 --> 00:02:47,633
One true flame the shadows fear,

36
00:02:48,431 --> 00:02:50,824
Every trick disappears.

37
00:03:06,063 --> 00:03:11,967
Snake on the ground, illusions quake,

38
00:03:14,681 --> 00:03:22,899
Power to the stick that eats the snakes.
